{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Rigid.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Braided.Basic"],"declarations":31,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.braidImg_inv_hom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.braidImg_inv_hom","kind":"theorem","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L201-L205","doc":"**(PROVED)** Negative- then positive-crossing images compose to the identity (the other\nReidemeister-II direction). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.braidImg_hom_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.braidImg_hom_inv","kind":"theorem","line":194,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L194-L198","doc":"**(PROVED)** Positive- then negative-crossing images compose to the identity — the\nReidemeister-II move at the level of the functor's images. A genuine `Iso` law, not a tautology. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.twistImg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.twistImg","kind":"def","line":189,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L189-L191","doc":"Canonical **framing-twist** image: the carried ribbon twist `θ_X : X ⟶ X`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.braidNegImg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.braidNegImg","kind":"def","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L185-L187","doc":"Canonical **negative-crossing** image: the inverse braiding `(β_ X Y).inv : Y ⊗ X ⟶ X ⊗ Y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.braidPosImg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.braidPosImg","kind":"def","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L181-L183","doc":"Canonical **positive-crossing** image: the braiding `(β_ X Y).hom : X ⊗ Y ⟶ Y ⊗ X`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.capImg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.capImg","kind":"def","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L177-L179","doc":"Canonical **cap** image: the evaluation `ε_ V Vᘁ : Vᘁ ⊗ V ⟶ 𝟙_𝒞`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.cupImg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.cupImg","kind":"def","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L173-L175","doc":"Canonical **cup** image: the coevaluation `η_ V Vᘁ : 𝟙_𝒞 ⟶ V ⊗ Vᘁ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.mapObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.mapObj","kind":"def","line":167,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L167-L171","doc":"Object map on a whole sign word: fold the coloring with the monoidal product, `[] ↦ 𝟙_𝒞`.\nThis is the intended `F` on objects; the total `F` on morphisms is the open assembly. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.colorObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.colorObj","kind":"def","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L162-L165","doc":"Object coloring: `+ ↦ V`, `− ↦ Vᘁ` (right dual). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.twist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.twist","kind":"def","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L156-L156","doc":"The ribbon/balancing twist `θ_X : X ⟶ X`, carried as data (no Mathlib ribbon typeclass). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.V","kind":"def","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L154-L154","doc":"The coloring object attached to a `+` point; a `−` point is colored by its right dual `Vᘁ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L152-L152","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.RibbonFunctorData","kind":"structure","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L149-L156","doc":"**The data of a Reshetikhin–Turaev ribbon functor** into a Mathlib braided right-rigid category:\na coloring object `V` and a ribbon/balancing `twist` (an endomorphism family), the latter carried as\n*data* since Mathlib provides no ribbon/balanced structure. Content-bearing, not `True`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.twistInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.twistInv","kind":"ctor","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L134-L135","doc":"**Inverse framing twist** `θ⁻¹` (a `−1` curl), `[s] ⟶ [s]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.twist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.twist","kind":"ctor","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L132-L133","doc":"**Framing twist** `θ` (a `+1` curl) on a single strand, `[s] ⟶ [s]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.braidNeg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.braidNeg","kind":"ctor","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L129-L131","doc":"**Negative crossing** (under-braid), `[s, t] ⟶ [t, s]`.  Inverse of `braidPos` after the\nReidemeister-II relation, which is **not** imposed on this free datatype. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.braidPos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.braidPos","kind":"ctor","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L127-L128","doc":"**Positive crossing** (over-braid) of two adjacent strands, `[s, t] ⟶ [t, s]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.cap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.cap","kind":"ctor","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L125-L126","doc":"**Cap** (annihilation / evaluation): a `∩`, `[s, s̄] ⟶ []`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.cup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.cup","kind":"ctor","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L123-L124","doc":"**Cup** (creation / coevaluation): a `∪` of a strand and its reverse, `[] ⟶ [s, s̄]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.tensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.tensor","kind":"ctor","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L120-L122","doc":"Horizontal composition (side-by-side juxtaposition); boundaries concatenate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.comp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.comp","kind":"ctor","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L118-L119","doc":"Vertical composition (stacking one tangle atop another). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.id","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor.id","kind":"ctor","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L116-L117","doc":"The empty/identity tangle on a boundary `X`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleMor","kind":"inductive","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L112-L135","doc":"**The free datatype of tangle diagrams** on the oriented-framed generators.  Constructors are\nthe generating morphisms plus formal `id`/`comp`/`tensor`; the geometric relations are **not**\nimposed (see the file docstring, obligation 2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.append_nil_object","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.append_nil_object","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L100-L102","doc":"**(PROVED)** The empty object is a right unit for the tensor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.nil_append_object","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.nil_append_object","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L96-L98","doc":"**(PROVED)** The empty object is a left unit for the tensor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.tangleObject_append_assoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.tangleObject_append_assoc","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L91-L94","doc":"**(PROVED)** The object monoid is associative — a real fact via `List.append_assoc`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleObject.tensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleObject.tensor","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L88-L89","doc":"Monoidal product on objects = concatenation of sign words. `abbrev` so it unfolds to `++`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleObject.unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleObject.unit","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L85-L86","doc":"The empty tangle boundary — the monoidal unit object. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleObject","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.TangleObject","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L82-L83","doc":"**An object of the tangle category**: a finite oriented sign word (boundary of a tangle). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.Sign.bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.Sign.bar","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L79-L80","doc":"Orientation reversal (`bar`): swaps `+ ↔ −`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.Sign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.FramedTangle.Sign","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneFramedTangleScaffold.lean#L76-L77","doc":"Orientation of a boundary point: `true = +` (up), `false = −` (down). ","signatureChunk":0}]}